Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.component.names|XSL|
		|testray.main.component.name|XSL|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|XSL Content|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|System Settings|
	Then XSLContent configure Configuration Admin XSL

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add XSL
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|XSLContent#AddXSL|
	When ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|Test XML Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|test.xml|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Test XML Title|
	And PermissionsInline goto DM Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Test XML Title|
	And PermissionsInline add Or Remove View Permission From All Roles
		|addOrRemoveViewPermission|Add|
		|roleList|Guest|
	And IFrame close Frame
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And DMDocument add CP
		|dmDocumentDescription|Test XSL Description|
		|dmDocumentFile|test.xsl|
		|dmDocumentTitle|Test XSL Title|
	And PermissionsInline goto DM Document CP
		|dmDocumentTitle|Test XSL Title|
	And PermissionsInline add Or Remove View Permission From All Roles
		|addOrRemoveViewPermission|Add|
		|roleList|Guest|
	And IFrame close Frame
	And ProductMenu goto Site
		|site|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And XSLContent goto Document URL
		|dmDocumentTitle|Test XML Title|
	And these variables
		|valueName|selenium#getElementValue('//input[contains(@id,\'url\')]')|
##########################################################
The Poshi echo element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And these variables
		|xmlURL||
##########################################################
The Poshi echo element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	And XSLContent goto Document URL
		|dmDocumentTitle|Test XSL Title|
	And these variables
		|valueName|selenium#getElementValue('//input[contains(@id,\'url\')]')|
##########################################################
The Poshi echo element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And these variables
		|xslURL||
##########################################################
The Poshi echo element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And SelectFrame at locator 'IFrame#DIALOG'
	And Type the value '@portal_url@/${xmlURL}' at locator 'TextInput#SETUP_XML_URL'
	And Type the value '@portal_url@/${xslURL}' at locator 'TextInput#SETUP_XSL_URL'
	And Click at locator 'Button#SAVE'
	And Alert view Success Message
	And SelectFrameTop the value 'relative=top'
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And XSLContent view XSL Portlet Hymn Display
		|tableArtistEntry|Dallán Forgaill|
		|tableCountryEntry|Ireland|
		|tableTitleEntry|Be Thou my Vision|
		|tableYearEntry|700|
	Then XSLContent view XSL Portlet Hymn Display
		|tableArtistEntry|Stanley Gai|
		|tableCountryEntry|US|
		|tableTitleEntry|Say Something|
		|tableYearEntry|2015|
Scenario: Configure Portlet With Corrupt XML
