Scenario: View XSL Default Content
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|XSLContent#ViewXSLDefaultContent|
	When Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet view PG
		|portletBody|Belgian Waffles|
		|portletName|XSL Content|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Test Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	Then XSLContent view Configuration XSL Content